+# Pulseboard
+
+> A web product that turns meeting transcripts into facilitator-confirmed, owned, and dated follow-up actions.
+
+**Status**: Spec phase · The project vision is complete; planning and implementation have not started.
+
+## What is this?
+
+Pulseboard helps team facilitators prevent weekly-meeting action items from disappearing. Facilitators upload a transcript, review proposed actions, and confirm an owner and due date before an action can be scheduled for a reminder. The first pilot serves five teams and measures review completion and the reduction in unowned overdue actions.
+
+Pulseboard is not a meeting recorder, calendar replacement, or autonomous message sender. Whether its first reminder channel should be email or Slack remains a pilot decision.
